Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.45,0:00:04.05,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a fight in that second set.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N第二盘拼得真激烈
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.50,0:00:06.55,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}王欣瑜{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}7{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.55,0:00:09.44,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}不敌帕克斯 东京首轮出局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.45,0:00:15.60,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}第一盘输了 第二盘却{\fs78}3{\fs68}次只差一分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.60,0:00:17.91,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}就能把比赛拖进决胜盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.91,0:00:21.35,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}这场失利 最可惜的是哪一步？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.45,0:00:24.10,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}先看第一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.10,0:00:26.20,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}帕克斯在底线左右调动
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.20,0:00:28.34,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}还能把防守的球顶回来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.34,0:00:30.51,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}王欣瑜二发七分只拿一分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.51,0:00:31.82,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}两次发球局失守
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.82,0:00:34.04,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}局面很快就被拉开
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.24,0:00:44.35,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That's outstanding.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N太精彩了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.10,0:00:47.40,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Stayed in the rally really well.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这段相持她顶得真好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.55,0:00:48.56,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}落后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.56,0:00:51.51,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}自己的发球局又被逼到破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.51,0:00:55.11,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}帕克斯往前压 王欣瑜只能继续追
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.66,0:01:00.40,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Superb from Parks, who does make the breakthrough in this first set.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N帕克斯打得漂亮 拿下首盘关键破发
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:02.60,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Parks leads by three games to one.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N帕克斯三比一领先
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.75,0:01:04.45,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}从底线打到网前
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.45,0:01:06.42,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}帕克斯没有放松
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.71,0:01:10.01,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Fifteen-thirty.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N十五比三十
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.51,0:01:13.53,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}首盘盘点 王欣瑜还在追球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.53,0:01:16.75,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}可这一盘 最后停在了{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.18,0:01:18.06,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Game and first set.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N第一盘结束
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.16,0:01:21.26,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Well, that is an excellent first set from Alycia Parks.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N帕克斯这盘打得非常出色
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.34,0:01:22.41,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Dominant scoreline.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比分相当悬殊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.51,0:01:24.59,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}第二盘 最明显的变化
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.59,0:01:27.34,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}是王欣瑜守住了自己的发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.34,0:01:30.60,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}她的二发得分 从首盘七分只拿一分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.60,0:01:33.64,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}升到次盘{\fs78}13{\fs68}分拿下{\fs78}12{\fs68}分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.38,0:01:40.53,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a touch from Wang Xinyu.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N王欣瑜这手感真好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.63,0:01:42.87,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}但帕克斯也没丢发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.87,0:01:45.83,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}两人一路保发 王欣瑜{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}领先
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.83,0:01:48.38,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}终于等来本盘第一个盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.08,0:01:51.68,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Just catching the edge of the line.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N刚好压在边线上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.08,0:01:54.13,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Parks thought that was going to be out.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N帕克斯以为这球会出界
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.33,0:01:55.81,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}盘点到了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.81,0:01:57.30,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}帕克斯往网前压
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.30,0:02:00.76,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}王欣瑜左右追球 还是没能拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.78,0:02:06.43,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, what a shot! What a point from Parks to rescue it.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N好球！帕克斯用这一分救回盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.53,0:02:07.97,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}第一次机会没抓住
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.97,0:02:11.37,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}双方又各保一局 比赛进入抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.37,0:02:12.52,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}随后{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.52,0:02:15.55,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}第二个盘点又来到王欣瑜手里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.80,0:02:21.60,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That's nicely put away.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这球收得漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.95,0:02:25.70,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Earlier in the set.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一盘早些时候
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.72,0:02:34.80,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Too good.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这球太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.00,0:02:38.00,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Outstanding from Alycia Parks.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N帕克斯打得太出色了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.19,0:02:39.67,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}机会还没完
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.67,0:02:42.89,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} 王欣瑜第三次握住盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.89,0:02:45.92,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}只要再赢这一分 就有第三盘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.92,0:02:47.39,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}帕克斯又一次顶住
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.39,0:02:49.52,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}继续往网前逼近
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.90,0:02:56.70,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That is superbly put away.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这球收得非常漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.80,0:02:58.99,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}从{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}到{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}8{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.99,0:03:00.84,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}王欣瑜没等来第三盘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.84,0:03:03.13,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}却等来了对手的赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.80,0:03:06.07,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}轮到帕克斯{\fs78}8{\fs68}比{\fs78}7{\fs68}领先时
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.07,0:03:08.66,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}她迎来了第一个赛点 这次
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.66,0:03:11.24,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}比赛没有再给王欣瑜机会
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.10,0:03:18.70,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a fight in that second set.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N第二盘拼得真激烈
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.15,0:03:25.25,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Alycia Parks extends her winning run in Tokyo, having come through qualifying.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N资格赛打起 她在东京继续赢球
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.30,0:03:29.70,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She defeats Wang Xinyu in the first round.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她在首轮击败王欣瑜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.45,0:03:35.00,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Had to really dig deep in that second set to avoid a decider.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N次盘苦战 才没被拖入决胜盘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.05,0:03:39.85,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Saving three set points and eventually taking that tie-break.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N挽救三个盘点 最终赢下抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.98,0:03:42.70,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}全场制胜分 {\fs78}10{\fs68}比{\fs78}29{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.70,0:03:46.03,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}两盘下来 王欣瑜一次也没能破发
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.03,0:03:47.50,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}她把第二盘撑住了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.50,0:03:50.08,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}却没能把机会变成胜势
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.98,0:03:56.89,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}从{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}打到{\fs78}3{\fs68}次盘点 抵抗是真实的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.89,0:03:59.23,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}下一次 能不能把这份抵抗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.23,0:04:01.19,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}变成一场胜利？
